{"id":"72f7b5109e33fa0f","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-smullyan-free-variables.md","title":"Free Variables and All Variable Occurrences","display":"df-smullyan-free-variables — Free Variables and All Variable Occurrences","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-smullyan-free-variables","aliases":["92-df-smullyan-free-variables"],"display":"df-smullyan-free-variables — Free Variables and All Variable Occurrences","source":"第 II 章 pp. 15–16；第 III 章 p. 29（PDF 32–33、46）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-smullyan-formulas]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-smullyan-free-variables"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-smullyan-free-variables</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-smullyan-free-variables — Free Variables and All Variable Occurrences"},{"key":"source","html":"第 II 章 pp. 15–16；第 III 章 p. 29（PDF 32–33、46）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"40c0018b6d45300e\" href=\"?note=40c0018b6d45300e\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-formulas\">92-df-smullyan-formulas</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,s\">\\(t,s\\)</span> 为原书项，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,H\">\\(F,H\\)</span> 为原书公式，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\geq1\">\\(i\\geq1\\)</span>；构造器见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"40c0018b6d45300e\" href=\"?note=40c0018b6d45300e\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-formulas\">92-df-smullyan-formulas</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_E=\\{v_i^E:i\\geq1\\}\">\\(V_E=\\{v_i^E:i\\geq1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_E,\\mathrm{Occ}_E\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_E,\\mathrm{Occ}_E\\)</span> 的共同定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Term}_E\\cup\\mathrm{Fml}_E\">\\(\\mathrm{Term}_E\\cup\\mathrm{Fml}_E\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}free\\text{-}variables}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FV}_E(\\nu_n^E)&amp;=\\mathrm{Occ}_E(\\nu_n^E)=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_E(v_i^E)&amp;=\\mathrm{Occ}_E(v_i^E)=\\{v_i^E\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_E(t&#39;)&amp;=\\mathrm{FV}_E(t),&amp;\\mathrm{Occ}_E(t&#39;)&amp;=\\mathrm{Occ}_E(t),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_E(\\operatorname{bin}_{E,j}(s,t))&amp;=\\mathrm{FV}_E(s)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_E(t),&amp;\n\\mathrm{Occ}_E(\\operatorname{bin}_{E,j}(s,t))&amp;=\\mathrm{Occ}_E(s)\\cup\\mathrm{Occ}_E(t),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_E(\\operatorname{eq}_E(s,t))&amp;=\\mathrm{FV}_E(\\operatorname{le}_E(s,t))=\\mathrm{FV}_E(s)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_E(t),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Occ}_E(\\operatorname{eq}_E(s,t))&amp;=\\mathrm{Occ}_E(\\operatorname{le}_E(s,t))=\\mathrm{Occ}_E(s)\\cup\\mathrm{Occ}_E(t),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_E(\\neg_E F)&amp;=\\mathrm{FV}_E(F),&amp;\\mathrm{Occ}_E(\\neg_E F)&amp;=\\mathrm{Occ}_E(F),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_E(F\\supset H)&amp;=\\mathrm{FV}_E(F)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_E(H),&amp;\n\\mathrm{Occ}_E(F\\supset H)&amp;=\\mathrm{Occ}_E(F)\\cup\\mathrm{Occ}_E(H),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_E(\\forall v_i^E F)&amp;=\\mathrm{FV}_E(F)\\setminus\\{v_i^E\\},&amp;\n\\mathrm{Occ}_E(\\forall v_i^E F)&amp;=\\mathrm{Occ}_E(F)\\cup\\{v_i^E\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sent}_E&amp;\\coloneqq\\{F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_E:\\mathrm{FV}_E(F)=\\varnothing\\},&amp;\n\\mathrm{Sent}_A&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sent}_E\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_A.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}free\\text{-}variables}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FV}_E(\\nu_n^E)&amp;=\\mathrm{Occ}_E(\\nu_n^E)=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_E(v_i^E)&amp;=\\mathrm{Occ}_E(v_i^E)=\\{v_i^E\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_E(t&#39;)&amp;=\\mathrm{FV}_E(t),&amp;\\mathrm{Occ}_E(t&#39;)&amp;=\\mathrm{Occ}_E(t),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_E(\\operatorname{bin}_{E,j}(s,t))&amp;=\\mathrm{FV}_E(s)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_E(t),&amp;\n\\mathrm{Occ}_E(\\operatorname{bin}_{E,j}(s,t))&amp;=\\mathrm{Occ}_E(s)\\cup\\mathrm{Occ}_E(t),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_E(\\operatorname{eq}_E(s,t))&amp;=\\mathrm{FV}_E(\\operatorname{le}_E(s,t))=\\mathrm{FV}_E(s)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_E(t),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Occ}_E(\\operatorname{eq}_E(s,t))&amp;=\\mathrm{Occ}_E(\\operatorname{le}_E(s,t))=\\mathrm{Occ}_E(s)\\cup\\mathrm{Occ}_E(t),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_E(\\neg_E F)&amp;=\\mathrm{FV}_E(F),&amp;\\mathrm{Occ}_E(\\neg_E F)&amp;=\\mathrm{Occ}_E(F),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_E(F\\supset H)&amp;=\\mathrm{FV}_E(F)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_E(H),&amp;\n\\mathrm{Occ}_E(F\\supset H)&amp;=\\mathrm{Occ}_E(F)\\cup\\mathrm{Occ}_E(H),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_E(\\forall v_i^E F)&amp;=\\mathrm{FV}_E(F)\\setminus\\{v_i^E\\},&amp;\n\\mathrm{Occ}_E(\\forall v_i^E F)&amp;=\\mathrm{Occ}_E(F)\\cup\\{v_i^E\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sent}_E&amp;\\coloneqq\\{F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_E:\\mathrm{FV}_E(F)=\\varnothing\\},&amp;\n\\mathrm{Sent}_A&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sent}_E\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_A.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>数码、变量和非数码后继项的递归条款相容；所有像均为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_E\">\\(V_E\\)</span> 的有限子集。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Occ}_E\">\\(\\mathrm{Occ}_E\\)</span> 计入量词绑定处，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_E\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_E\\)</span> 只计自由出现。原书 L5 的条件是变量完全不出现，而不是只要求不自由；L6 与归纳包装中的新变量条件也据此理解。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-smullyan-formulas","status":"resolved","id":"40c0018b6d45300e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-formulas]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-formulas","status":"resolved","id":"40c0018b6d45300e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$t,s$ 为原书项，$F,H$ 为原书公式，$i\\geq1$；构造器见 [[92-df-smullyan-formulas]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"t,s","display":false},{"tex":"F,H","display":false},{"tex":"i\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"V_E=\\{v_i^E:i\\geq1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_E,\\mathrm{Occ}_E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Term}_E\\cup\\mathrm{Fml}_E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}free\\text{-}variables}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FV}_E(\\nu_n^E)&=\\mathrm{Occ}_E(\\nu_n^E)=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_E(v_i^E)&=\\mathrm{Occ}_E(v_i^E)=\\{v_i^E\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_E(t')&=\\mathrm{FV}_E(t),&\\mathrm{Occ}_E(t')&=\\mathrm{Occ}_E(t),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_E(\\operatorname{bin}_{E,j}(s,t))&=\\mathrm{FV}_E(s)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_E(t),&\n\\mathrm{Occ}_E(\\operatorname{bin}_{E,j}(s,t))&=\\mathrm{Occ}_E(s)\\cup\\mathrm{Occ}_E(t),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_E(\\operatorname{eq}_E(s,t))&=\\mathrm{FV}_E(\\operatorname{le}_E(s,t))=\\mathrm{FV}_E(s)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_E(t),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Occ}_E(\\operatorname{eq}_E(s,t))&=\\mathrm{Occ}_E(\\operatorname{le}_E(s,t))=\\mathrm{Occ}_E(s)\\cup\\mathrm{Occ}_E(t),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_E(\\neg_E F)&=\\mathrm{FV}_E(F),&\\mathrm{Occ}_E(\\neg_E F)&=\\mathrm{Occ}_E(F),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_E(F\\supset H)&=\\mathrm{FV}_E(F)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_E(H),&\n\\mathrm{Occ}_E(F\\supset H)&=\\mathrm{Occ}_E(F)\\cup\\mathrm{Occ}_E(H),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_E(\\forall v_i^E F)&=\\mathrm{FV}_E(F)\\setminus\\{v_i^E\\},&\n\\mathrm{Occ}_E(\\forall v_i^E F)&=\\mathrm{Occ}_E(F)\\cup\\{v_i^E\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sent}_E&\\coloneqq\\{F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_E:\\mathrm{FV}_E(F)=\\varnothing\\},&\n\\mathrm{Sent}_A&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sent}_E\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_A.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"V_E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Occ}_E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_E","display":false}],"bytes":2286,"backlinks":[{"id":"b9e3d57e94ce36b7","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"自由变量递归与原书一致，但定义域是 G 项/公式。原书字符文法版本及全部出现集另见 [[92-df-smullyan-free-variables]]；L5 的“不出现”条件比“不自由”更强。"},{"id":"634d28e30ada0b29","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a9f2cffd9da7a09c","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"原书造串构造器、派生联结词与 $\\mathrm{Occ}_E$ 见 [[92-df-smullyan-free-variables]]。"},{"id":"bd6b982556489ede","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$i\\geq1,n\\in\\mathbb N$；$t,s\\in\\mathrm{Term}_E$，$F,H\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_E$，原书构造器与变量集见 [[92-df-smullyan-free-variables]]。"},{"id":"6511106aac2e96b7","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-18","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书语法与公理：[[92-df-smullyan-terms]] → [[92-df-smullyan-formulas]] → [[92-df-smullyan-free-variables]] → [[92-df-smullyan-numeral-substitution]] → [[92-df-smullyan-truth]]。"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-119","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-free-variables]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-175","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-free-variables]]"}],"outgoing":["40c0018b6d45300e"]}